{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》劇情變得愈來愈緊湊，劇中由楊茜堯飾演的「復仇女王」不斷尋找誰才是殺死陳自瑤的兇手費盡心思。她除了徘徊在林夏薇、姚子羚、傅嘉莉及鄺潔楹中找證據外，亦在陳豪及馬國明身上尋找蛛絲馬跡。不過劇集始終圍繞著娛樂圈，難免有不少鹽花，由開播到現在，已經有多場尺度大膽的埸面。</p><figure><img alt=\"驚爆迷姦水設局陪客潛規則。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196157286738169856231670.jpeg/T1VBmp4Tt042DAtQ2NH3jBGJ_LYiKRY5cV_gb3Ff4G8\"/><figcaption>驚爆迷姦水設局陪客潛規則。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>盤點劇中重口味場面 迷姦裸照床戲連環爆 更有割喉炸車極恐怖</p><p>鹽花先有陳自瑤被落迷姦水遭迷姦，後有鄺潔楹做援交、姚子羚被拍裸照、陳展鵬被陳楨怡自拍床照及馬國明跟傅嘉莉的床戲。除此之外，亦有不少恐怖場面，例如：楊茜堯為證清堵自插一刀、鄺潔楹被林景程撞到飛起、鄺潔楹一上車就被炸、黃庭鋒被「掉落樓」、陳豪被割喉等。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤被迷姦。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261108/1196157282598129664784209.jpeg/HQ2xhht-Ok_tikTrFneiepnbDNRHRb7KNnnjljZ545Y\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤被迷姦。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳楨怡偷拍陳展鵬床照。（TVB.com）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261114/1198063869893808128936801.jpeg/LP5en6qq9lpK7dWncfg6j-h58aeo1fd_5t4MJebeDCU\"/><figcaption>陳楨怡偷拍陳展鵬床照。（TVB.com）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄺潔楹做援交。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198799019254484992907263.jpeg/H07fQjJJX7oajAja_ioLfqum7usj5zvc07yC69O8gus\"/><figcaption>鄺潔楹做援交。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄺潔楹在家與一位男士親熱。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198799024115945472429076.jpeg/-gNiPltRfx99npjHg-XTnMsr2KFcPQmzZsJxjWbCcY0\"/><figcaption>鄺潔楹在家與一位男士親熱。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄺潔楹應該是吸了毒。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198799026230005760860794.jpeg/8RUdDjXRsue8y_9vs_BUSyZCqBZB3qZrfvF-f37xfn8\"/><figcaption>鄺潔楹應該是吸了毒。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姚子羚被拖入公廁狂毆。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199086420015583232912740.jpeg/WnR1-rxfvd4H1TJASUoaB2ddO7PB2zHTeVnCf3lZwn8\"/><figcaption>姚子羚被拖入公廁狂毆。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姚子羚被強拍裸照。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199086417876357120708253.jpeg/L6OdovKE7Hu4BBbjijAPbbcaoR7OY7dPkaGh7JGhoew\"/><figcaption>姚子羚被強拍裸照。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馬國明同傅嘉莉。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199790833222553600170628.jpeg/14ji9Au1G5zx7yLVcK97qw0sp5bgHlNze9G4XnvRuF4\"/><figcaption>馬國明同傅嘉莉。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"片中可見陳自瑤被失去了自我意識，任由擺佈，最後被一男子拉開衣服再推下床。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199791203164360704259106.jpeg/zT-9qjN5zwUsEhYpU0_viaSgtlPLHZrIKC24oSgtuKE\"/><figcaption>片中可見陳自瑤被失去了自我意識，任由擺佈，最後被一男子拉開衣服再推下床。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊茜堯為證清白自插一刀。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196606878960848896015947.jpeg/-4UIXD_lo1rCS6J-Ax3HE0YyBCIarATKbP_I62z_yOs\"/><figcaption>楊茜堯為證清白自插一刀。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄺潔楹被林景程撞到飛起。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201346099357421568903246.jpeg/VDYplim59TieO19nuY0p5xIuA_s861SKJAZR-yQGUfs\"/><figcaption>鄺潔楹被林景程撞到飛起。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄺潔楹被林景程撞到飛起。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201346111722754048241390.jpeg/Z9_FarVuuKRbGhO2NRas2s3lZEuJThPLpCj7UqQo-1I\"/><figcaption>鄺潔楹被林景程撞到飛起。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃庭鋒被「掉落樓」。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201346109109571584279538.jpeg/l3KenESF9h3HwSSHeaZuqn7mv2aLzDtSSjbe1Eo23tQ\"/><figcaption>黃庭鋒被「掉落樓」。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃庭鋒被「掉落樓」。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201346106597052416239506.jpeg/sI-pZ97dSmxag29vGxaOQio44f-wkLrN2gM2SdoDNkk\"/><figcaption>黃庭鋒被「掉落樓」。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳豪被割喉。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201346104210362368384195.jpeg/xzp-XI-NKXueuaU0Q9SF3TlzQTVu-l7W3IPomtyD6Jo\"/><figcaption>陳豪被割喉。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳豪被割喉。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201346101756563456652890.jpeg/PcsjhPs7TO1NekaEb3tBeKn3_f-91XwLvPG1srzxtbI\"/><figcaption>陳豪被割喉。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.523357+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":612,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T00:30:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T00:57:24.603146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:37:22.242625+00:00","content_hash":"6f3b08b5b1e130823051a507f4d2ac0e0e31698900f6d9c459b17f8baa744ada","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}